### Page 4 of 10

```text
UDC-22-00064

April 4, 2022
RECOMMENDED MOTION:

Move to approve the rezoning of Lot 1, Block 1, Interior Heights, 4th Filing to the existing Harmony
Valley PUD as shown in the attached zone change map, noting that the project meets the review criteria
for approval.

APPLICABLE CITY CODE SECTION(S) AND PLANS:

•
UDC 2.2.1 Zoning Map Amendment
•
UDC Article 5
•
PlanCheyenne
•
Harmony Valley PUD

BACKGROUND:

This zone change application proposes changing the zoning from AR Agricultural Residential to the existing
Harmony Valley PUD. The land is currently developed with a single-family home. The purpose of the
proposed zone change is to allow for future residential redevelopment under the Harmony Valley PUD.

